text: |-
  Description:
  Dixie Regional Medical Center is a full-service,
  regional referral center serving the medical
  needs of Washington County and the tri-state
  area.
  Services: General in-patient and out-patient
  medical, surgical and obstetrical care; heart
  surgery and trauma services; Home Health and
  Hospice Services; Regional Cancer
  Center; Rehabilitation center; Wound Clinic,
  NICU and Community Health and
  Information Center.
  Fee: Fee counseling and payment plans
  available
  Service #s:
  • Behavioral Medicine: Inpatient psychiatric
  care; 435-688-4343
  • Business Office: Hospital billing, Financial
  Assistance: 435-251-2300
  • Community Health Information Center: 435-
  251-2222
  • Home Health and Hospice: 435-251-2367 or
  toll free 888-859-8944
  • Medical Equipment: 435-251-2323
